   "image": "brocante/brocante.jpg",
   "alt": "An open-air flea market on a lawn: a big wooden stall with a slate roof stands in the middle. On top: a row of white jugs with one red jug, a pair of boots, one with a pro shine and the dusty next one waiting, a mystery parcel riding in a little canoe and a crystal ball with a tiny rocket inside. In the middle: two teddies sharing a seesaw, a sweet pink-and-blue ice-cream van, a cracked old rocking horse and an everyday coat and hat on pegs. Below: two puppets acting in a little theatre and a brass gramophone. Two upholstered armchairs sit on the grass on the left; on the right stands a grandfather clock. Behind, a garden arch leads back to the market square, a red door opens in a little shed, and a blue door and a green door open in the outbuilding.",
